  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is implemented in Bosnia and Herzegovina (BiH). The main outcome area it contributes to are equality and workers&apos; rights. The main rights holders are workers and union members. This cooperation also aims to establish a collaborative framework where civil society, trade unions, and policymakers work together to champion the cause of decent work and living wages, setting a precedent for long-term, systemic change in the labour landscape of Bosnia and Herzegovina.</narrative>
  </description>
